        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Machine-Gun Hollow Flash.</em> You fire an uncountable barrage from both pistols. Canon has Starrk claim he can fire a thousand at once.</p><p>Each creature in a <strong>60-foot cone</strong> takes @Damage[2d6[force]] damage with a basic Reflex save. You may instead shape it as a <strong>120-foot line</strong>.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p><p><strong>Refined (9th)</strong> You may <strong>Sustain</strong> Cero Metralleta at the start of your next turn to fire it again in a different direction without spending a Reiatsu Point.</p><hr /><p><em>The largest technique area in the class, paid for by the smallest basic Strike.</em></p>"
